@startuml
title Digital Watch UML State Machine Diagram

state Start
state TimeView
state AdjustTime
state AlarmOnOff
state AlarmRing
state AlarmStop
state LightOn
state LightOff

[*]Start --> TimeView: View Time
TimeView --> AdjustTime: Adjust Time Settings
AdjustTime --> AdjustTime: Increase Values
AdjustTime --> TimeView: Done Adjusting
AlarmOnOff --> AlarmOnOff: On
AlarmOnOff --> AlarmOnOff: Off
AlarmOnOff --> AlarmRing: Match Current Time
AlarmRing --> AlarmStop: Stop Alarm
LightOn --> LightOn
LightOn --> LightOff: Button Released


title Online College Magazine System UML State Machine Diagram

state StartChoice
state Login
state Admin
state User
state ArticleCreation
state Editing
state Approval
state Searching
state Feedback

[*]StartChoice --> Login: Create Account or Log In
Login --> Admin: Admin Access
Admin --> AdminChoice: Choose Action
AdminChoice --> AddUser: Add User Profile
AdminChoice --> EditUser: Edit User Profile
AdminChoice --> RemoveUser: Remove User Profile
Admin --> User: User Access
User --> EditorChoice: Send Article for Editing
EditorChoice --> Editing: Edit Article
EditorChoice --> Approval: Pass for Approval
Approval --> PublishedArticle: Publish Article
PublishedArticle --> ReadFeedbackChoice: Read Articles
ReadFeedbackChoice --> Searching: Search for More Articles
ReadFeedbackChoice --> Feedback: Provide Feedback
Feedback --> End: Complete Session


title Smart Traffic Management System UML State Machine Diagram

state Start
state MonitorTraffic
state ControlStreetLights
state ManageSignals
state CheckViolation
state RecordFine
state PayFine
state SendWarning

[*]Start --> MonitorTraffic: Monitor Traffic Conditions
MonitorTraffic --> ControlStreetLights: Adjust Street Lights
ControlStreetLights --> ManageSignals: Manage Traffic Signals
ManageSignals --> CheckViolation: Detect Violations
CheckViolation --> RecordFine: Issue Fine
RecordFine --> PayFine: Pay Fine
PayFine --> End: Complete Process
CheckViolation --> SendWarning: No Violation
SendWarning --> End: Complete Process


title Online Marketplace UML State Machine Diagram

state Start
state Registration
state Login
state SellerWorkspace
state ProductAddition
state ProductPromotion
state CustomerDashboard
state Browsing
state Purchase

[*]Start --> Registration: Register as a User
Registration --> Login: Sign In and Access Workspace
Login --> SellerWorkspace: Seller Access
SellerWorkspace --> ProductAddition: Add New Products
SellerWorkspace --> ProductPromotion: Promote Existing Products
SellerWorkspace --> Login: Communicate with Customers
SellerWorkspace --> Logout: Leave the Platform
Login --> CustomerDashboard: Customer Access
CustomerDashboard --> Browsing: Explore Products
Browsing --> Purchase: Proceed with a Purchase
Purchase --> End: Complete Transaction
CustomerDashboard --> Searching: Search for More Products
Searching --> Browsing: Continue Browsing

@enduml
